# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRODUCTION build — admin portal (admin.vedhicfoods.com).
#
# TRACKED IN GIT ON PURPOSE, and for the same reason as
# frontend/.env.production: it holds no secret, and committing it means a deploy
# cannot ship an admin bundle pointed at localhost.
#
# The admin portal is a SEPARATE origin from the storefront. That is deliberate:
# served from the same origin, any XSS on the public storefront would also hold
# admin session reach. Both origins are listed in the backend's CORS allowlist
# (FRONTEND_URL / ADMIN_FRONTEND_URL) and in backend/infra/s3-cors.json — image
# upload is an admin-side call to the presigned S3 URL.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Same API host as the storefront. The admin portal is a separate ORIGIN, not a
# separate API.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.vedhicfoods.com/api/v1